      "relationships": "1: MATCH 16 -- Having a fan expresses the AHU–fan part relationship.\n2: MATCH 17 -- Having a filter expresses the AHU–filter part relationship.\n3: MATCH 18 -- Having a damper expresses the AHU–damper part relationship.\n4: MATCH 20 -- Having a cooling valve expresses the part relationship.\n5: MATCH 19 -- Having a heating valve expresses the part relationship.\n6: MATCH 21 -- Having an economizer expresses the part relationship.\n7: MATCH 8 -- It identifies the air temperature sensor as an AHU point.\n8: MATCH 13 -- It identifies the CO2 sensor as an AHU point.\n9: MATCH 9 -- It identifies the air temperature setpoint as an AHU point.\n10: MATCH 10 -- It identifies the cooling temperature setpoint as an AHU point.\n11: MATCH 11 -- It identifies the heating temperature setpoint as an AHU point.\n12: MATCH 12 -- It identifies the temperature deadband setpoint as an AHU point.\n13: NO MATCH -- Using a sensor does not establish it as a thermostat point.\n14: NO MATCH -- Using a setpoint does not establish it as a thermostat point.\n15: NO MATCH -- Association with a zone is weaker than being its point.\n16: NO MATCH -- Association with a building installation does not establish location.\n17: MATCH 1 -- Containing a floor expresses the part relationship.\n18: MATCH 2 -- Containing a space expresses the part relationship.\n19: MATCH 3 -- Including a controlled zone expresses the part relationship.\n20: MATCH 22 -- Serving a zone as its controlling device is serving that zone.\n21: MATCH 14 -- It identifies the outside air CO2 sensor as an AHU point.\n22: MATCH 15 -- It identifies the return air CO2 sensor as an AHU point.",
      "properties": "1: MATCH \"measuredTemperature\" -- Both denote the sensor's temperature reading.\n2: NO MATCH -- A temperature reading is not the sensor's status.\n3: MATCH \"measuredTemperature\" -- Both denote the air temperature reading.\n4: MATCH \"concentration\" -- Both denote the measured CO2 level.\n5: MATCH \"concentration\" -- Both denote the measured outside-air CO2 level.\n6: MATCH \"concentration\" -- Both denote the measured return-air CO2 level.\n7: MATCH \"targetTemperature\" -- Both denote the temperature setpoint value.\n8: MATCH \"targetTemperature\" -- Both denote the air-temperature setpoint value.\n9: MATCH \"targetTemperature\" -- Both denote the cooling setpoint value.\n10: MATCH \"targetTemperature\" -- Both denote the heating setpoint value.\n11: MATCH \"bandSize\" -- Both denote the deadband setpoint value.\n12: MATCH \"occupancy\" -- Both denote whether the space is occupied.\n13: NO MATCH -- Filter condition is not necessarily the same field as filter status.",
